CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyIntro::
    .string "Hi, you're a new face!\p"
    .string "I'm BRAWLY! I was surfing the big\n"
    .string "waves of HOENN, but the currents\l"
    .string "brought me to this GYM.\p"
    .string "I heard KANTO TRAINERS think they\n"
    .string "can beat FIGHTING-type POKéMON\l"
    .string "just by spamming FLYING moves.\p"
    .string "If that's your plan, you're going\n"
    .string "to wipe out hard!\p"
    .string "Prepare to be crushed by our\n"
    .string "overwhelming physical power!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM03::
    .string "TM08 teaches BULK UP.\p"
    .string "It buffs up your POKéMON's Attack\n"
    .string "and Defense stats simultaneously.\p"
    .string "Use it to turn the tides of any\n"
    .string "physical battle!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ExplainCascadeBadge::
    .string "The KNUCKLEBADGE makes all\n"
    .string "POKéMON up to Lv. 30 obey.\p"
    .string "That includes even outsiders you\n"
    .string "got in trades.\p"
    .string "There's more. You can now use CUT\n"
    .string "anytime, even out of battle.\p"
    .string "You can CUT down small trees to\n"
    .string "open new pathways.\p"
    .string "You can also have this TM to build\n"
    .string "some serious muscle.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM03FromMisty::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM08\n"
    .string "from BRAWLY.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_BetterMakeRoomForThis::
    .string "You better make room for this!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyDefeat::
    .string "Whoa!\n"
    .string "Swamped by a massive wave!\p"
    .string "All right!\p"
    .string "You can have the KNUCKLEBADGE to\n"
    .string "show you rode out my best attacks.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaIntro::
    .string "What? You?\n"
    .string "I'm more than good enough for you!\p"
    .string "BRAWLY won't even need to step up.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaDefeat::
    .string "My technique... broken!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaPostBattle::
    .string "You have to face other TRAINERS\n"
    .string "to see how tough you really are.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisIntro::
    .string "Hiyah!\p"
    .string "I'm first up!\n"
    .string "Let's trade blows!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisDefeat::
    .string "Knocked out cold!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisPostBattle::
    .string "BRAWLY is a TRAINER who has faced\n"
    .string "the roughest seas.\p"
    .string "He won't lose to a rookie like you!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "Let me give you some advice!\p"
    .string "The LEADER, BRAWLY, is a master of\n"
    .string "FIGHTING-type POKéMON.\p"
    .string "You can strike them from above with\n"
    .string "FLYING-type POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Or, you might use PSYCHIC-type\n"
    .string "POKéMON and mess with their minds!\p"
    .string "But watch out! He knows how to\n"
    .string "counter those tricks!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_WeMakePrettyGoodTeam::
    .string "You beat BRAWLY!\n"
    .string "See, what'd I tell ya?\p"
    .string "You and me, kid, we make a pretty\n"
    .string "darn-good team!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "CERULEAN POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: BRAWLY\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "CERULEAN POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: BRAWLY\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"

